# Legacy root mirrors (W6) — never commit the binary live DB copy.
# Source of truth: data/influ.sqlite. Opt-in write: ENABLE_LEGACY_MIRRORS=1.
# personas.json = intentional text roster mirror (git backup may stage it; still
# gitignored by default so routine saves do not force-add without ENABLE).
influ.sqlite
influ.sqlite-journal
influ.sqlite-wal
influ.sqlite-shm
personas.json
scratch/**/*.sqlite
scratch/**/*.sqlite-*

